WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.853
A language switcher serves the
reader who cannot read the page

2
00:00:03.853 --> 00:00:04.688
they landed on.

3
00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:07.782
Name each language
in its own language,

4
00:00:07.782 --> 00:00:10.452
such as Deutsch, and skip flags,

5
00:00:10.452 --> 00:00:11.983
which represent countries.

6
00:00:12.383 --> 00:00:14.043
Link to the same page,

7
00:00:14.043 --> 00:00:16.110
remember the choice in a cookie,

8
00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:19.267
and never redirect a localized URL.

9
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.597
General Translation labels each
language in its own name and

10
00:00:23.597 --> 00:00:24.827
remembers the choice.

11
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:30.898
In gt-next, the LocaleSelector
component renders a native select

12
00:00:30.898 --> 00:00:32.442
of your configured locales.

13
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:37.167
For public pages, its Link
component adds crawlable links with

14
00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:38.397
hreflang.

15
00:00:38.797 --> 00:00:41.315
Your team now ships
German with each release.
